# Shell scripts must keep LF line endings regardless of the checkout
# platform's core.autocrlf setting. A CRLF-terminated script breaks its
# shebang inside Linux containers (e.g. backend/docker-entrypoint.sh,
# COPYed into the backend image and run as ENTRYPOINT): "#!/bin/sh\r" is
# not a valid interpreter path, and Docker reports this as the script
# itself being missing.
*.sh text eol=lf
